<title>GERMANY: BADMINTON-RESULTS OF FINALS IN GERMAN OPEN.</title>
<headline>BADMINTON-RESULTS OF FINALS IN GERMAN OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>SAARBRUECKEN, Germany 1996-10-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of finals</p>
<p>in the $125,000 German Open badminton tournament on Sunday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Men</p>
<p>2-Rashid Sidek (Malaysia) 3/4-Hock Ong Ewe 15-11 15-2</p>
<p>Women</p>
<p>Jie Yao (China) beat 5/8-Margit Borg (Sweden) 11-1 11-0</p>
</text>
